sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant WEB as Web Platform<br/>(or HoloLens Edit)
    participant API as Django REST API<br/>PUT /buildings-energy/
    participant DB as PostgreSQL<br/>+ PostGIS
    participant SIG as Django Signal<br/>post_save
    participant REDIS as Redis<br/>Channel Layer
    participant CON as BuildingEnergy<br/>Consumer (ASGI)
    participant WS as WebSocket<br/>(wss://)
    participant HL as HoloLens 2<br/>BuildingWebSocketClient
    participant BEM as BuildingEnergy<br/>Manager (Unity)
    participant VIZ as CesiumFeature<br/>Colorizer

    Note over WEB,VIZ: Stage 1: REST API Write
    WEB->>+API: PUT /geospatial/buildings-energy/{gml_id}/<br/>{"heating_system": "heat_pump", ...}
    API->>+DB: UPDATE building SET ... WHERE gml_id = ?
    DB-->>-API: Updated record (with recalculated energy + color)
    API-->>-WEB: 200 OK { full building JSON }

    Note over DB,SIG: Stage 2: Django Signal Dispatch
    DB-)SIG: post_save signal fires<br/>sender=BuildingEnergy, instance=updated

    Note over SIG,REDIS: Stage 3: Serialization + Group Send
    SIG->>SIG: _serialize_building(instance)<br/>JSON matching API response format
    SIG->>+REDIS: async_to_sync(channel_layer.group_send)<br/>group="buildings_08417008"<br/>type="building_updated", data={...}

    Note over REDIS,CON: Stage 4: Redis Distribution
    REDIS-->>-CON: Pub/Sub fan-out to all<br/>subscribed consumers in group

    Note over CON,HL: Stage 5: WebSocket Delivery
    CON->>CON: building_updated(event)<br/>check self.authenticated
    CON->>WS: send_json({"type": "building_updated",<br/>"data": { full building JSON }})
    WS->>HL: WebSocket text frame<br/>(~500 bytes)

    Note over HL,VIZ: Client-Side Processing
    HL->>HL: Background thread enqueues<br/>to Queue string (lock)
    HL->>BEM: Update() main-thread dispatch<br/>OnBuildingUpdated event
    BEM->>BEM: ParseSingleBuilding(JObject)<br/>Update buildingDataCache[gmlId]<br/>Update buildingColorCache[gmlId]
    BEM->>VIZ: RecolorSingleBuilding(gmlId, color)<br/>Update vertex colors on tile mesh
    BEM->>WS: ACK {"type":"ack", "gml_id":"..."}
    WS->>CON: Diagnostic acknowledgement

    Note over WEB,VIZ: Total latency: 200-500 ms end-to-end
